      "version": 282,
      "versionNonce": 243935910,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782231265770,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Consistency model\n\nPostgres transaction commits domain state + outbox row. \nWorker publishes event after commit. \nIdempotency keys and unique constraints make retries safe.\nLedger is append-only. \nAllocation/cap-table updates use row locks or optimistic versions.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Consistency model\n\nPostgres transaction commits domain state + outbox row. \nWorker publishes event after commit. \nIdempotency keys and unique constraints make retries safe.\nLedger is append-only. \nAllocation/cap-table updates use row locks or optimistic versions.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "at",
      "autoResize": true
    },
