      "version": 100,
      "versionNonce": 1585047014,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782231265770,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Security and privacy\n\nSeparate PII schema, field-level encryption, KMS envelope keys, strict audit logs. \nTenant isolation with org_id on every table + RLS. \nSigned URL access, virus scanning, retention policy, SOC2 evidence trail.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Security and privacy\n\nSeparate PII schema, field-level encryption, KMS envelope keys, strict audit logs. \nTenant isolation with org_id on every table + RLS. \nSigned URL access, virus scanning, retention policy, SOC2 evidence trail.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "av",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "c4ff0a3fb09e443f",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 665.5527475994293,
      "y": 1210.061962820982,
      "width": 618.4149389073079,
